    },
    ". We're building a mobile version of Cloudless, and an account is what links your desktop and mobile experience together.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". We're building a mobile version of Cloudless, and an account is what links your desktop and mobile experience together."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Nous développons une version mobile de Cloudless, et c'est votre compte qui relie votre expérience sur ordinateur et sur mobile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ". Without a way to reach our users, improving the product gets a lot harder. If you want Cloudless to keep getting better, an account helps us make that happen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Without a way to reach our users, improving the product gets a lot harder. If you want Cloudless to keep getting better, an account helps us make that happen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Sans moyen de joindre nos utilisateurs, améliorer le produit devient bien plus difficile. Si vous voulez que Cloudless continue de s'améliorer, un compte nous y aide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ". Your Pro subscription (or early-user free Smart Cleanup) is tied to your account, so it follows you when you reinstall, switch Macs, or clear your data.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Your Pro subscription (or early-user free Smart Cleanup) is tied to your account, so it follows you when you reinstall, switch Macs, or clear your data."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Votre abonnement Pro (ou le Smart Cleanup gratuit des premiers utilisateurs) est lié à votre compte : il vous suit si vous réinstallez l'app, changez de Mac ou effacez vos données."
          }
        }
      }
    },
